OL,3,GNEWSAHousing provider backtracks on
OL,4,Aaccommodation pledge after fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents evacuated from a fire-hit
OL,7,Fbuilding are no longer having their
OL,8,Ftemporary housing costs covered,
OL,9,Fdespite their landlord's initial pledge
OL,10,Fto do so.
OL,12,FCatherine Baldwin was one of those
OL,13,Fliving in flats in Henrietta Close in
OL,14,FAddlestone, Surrey, under a shared
OL,15,Fownership scheme with PA Housing, until
OL,16,Fthe blaze ripped through the building
OL,17,Fin May 2025.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
