OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHousing provider backtracks on
OL,4,Aaccommodation pledge after fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn letters seen by the BBC, PA Housing
OL,7,Ftold Baldwin after the fire that it
OL,8,Fwould "continue to support you
OL,9,Fthroughout your stay in temporary
OL,10,Faccommodation for as long as necessary
OL,11,Funtil you can return home".
OL,13,FIt said: "However, we couldn't have
OL,14,Fenvisaged the extent of the remediation
OL,15,Fwork needed until we had completed our
OL,16,Fstructural investigations."
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
